   "properties": {
    "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
    "ver": "0.31.0",
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## MiniMax H3 Turbo+Cache (image-to-video, EXPERIMENTAL)\n\nOmni-modal video model: up to 15s of 24fps video with native stereo audio\n(dialog in 11 languages). Requires ComfyUI 0.30.0+.\n\n`length` is a frame count at 24fps, snapped up to the model's 17k+5 grid\n(124 = ~5s, trained range is ~124-362 = ~5-15s). Canvas max is 768x1344-area\n(~1MP); this workflow defaults to 864x480 (~0.4MP, the\nofficial template default).\n\nThe `MiniMaxH3MemoryEfficientSageAttentionPatch` node (kjnodes) needs the\n`sageattention` pip package on the server; delete or bypass it to run without.\n\n**Models** (from [Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)):\n\n- `diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- `text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors`\n- `vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors`\n- `vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`\n\n\n**Turbo variant:** larryvrh 4-8 step distill LoRA (`minimax_h3_turbo_v4_step600_ema.safetensors`, strength 1.0) via the `ComfyUI-MiniMax-H3-Turbo` custom nodes (Turbo LoRA + Turbo Sampler), 8 steps / `simple` scheduler instead of 20-step `res_multistep`. ~2x faster; drop to 6 or 4 steps for more speed at some quality/motion-smear cost.\n\n**Cache variant:** adds `SpectrumApplyMiniMaxH3` (xmarre/ComfyUI-Spectrum-MiniMax-H3, default audio-protecting settings) on top of the turbo LoRA: ~1.4x faster again (50s vs 70s per 5s clip on a Blackwell). Not lossless; ear-test dialog for audio stutter before relying on it."
   ],
   "title": "About this workflow"
  },
